+#### Just Process ID
+
+- `just_pid()` - Process ID of the `just` executable.
+
+For example:
+
+```just
+pid:
+  @echo The process ID is: {{ just_pid() }}
+```
+
+```sh
+$ just
+The process ID is: 420
+```
+
